{"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GamePlugin"}],"symbolKind":"protocol","externalID":"s:6Gnusto10GamePluginP","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GamePlugin"}],"title":"GamePlugin","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Protocol","modules":[{"name":"Gnusto"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GamePlugin"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sendable"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Plugins","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/AddingCustomVerbs","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/WritingRules"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A plugin bundles the player-typeable vocabulary a system needs ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"buy"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"attack"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ask"},{"type":"text","text":") with the logic that reacts to it, so the system can be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shipped once and reused instead of hand-copied into every game."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct CommercePlugin: GamePlugin {","    static let buy = Intent(\"buy\")","","    var verbs: [SyntaxRule] {","        SyntaxRule(\"buy\", .directObject, intent: Self.buy)","    }","}"]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Logic-only-a-plugin-owns-no-state","text":"Logic-only: a plugin owns no state"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unlike a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContent","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" bundle, a plugin is "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" reflected by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bootstrap, so it declares no rooms, items, or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Global"},{"type":"text","text":" state of its own. It"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"operates entirely over entities and globals the "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"host","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" declares, receiving"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what it needs as parameters. That keeps a plugin portable: it makes no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"assumptions about the host’s world beyond the traits and intents it agrees"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on. A plugin that genuinely needs to ship its own content is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContent","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" bundle instead (list it in the game’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"The-host-opts-in-by-splicing","text":"The host opts in by splicing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The host stores the plugin as a plain property and splices its vocabulary,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default actions, and rules into its own blocks. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"verbs"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actions"},{"type":"text","text":" each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"merge just like a game’s own, and the plugin’s rule factories return"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Rules","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" the host composes in. Together, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"verbs"},{"type":"text","text":" + "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actions"},{"type":"text","text":" let a plugin"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ship a whole verb behavior — vocabulary and stage-4 default — without any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"host rules at all; a host only needs its own rules to embellish or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"override that default for specific entities."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct LampShop: Game {","    let commerce = CommercePlugin()","    @Global var purse = Purse(coins: 10)","    let lantern = Item { name(\"brass lantern\"); trait(.price, 5) }","","    var verbs: [SyntaxRule] { commerce.verbs }","    var rules: Rules {","        commerce.purchase(of: lantern,","                          balance: { purse.coins },","                          charge:  { purse.coins -= $0 })","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The protocol’s own "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/rules","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" requirement carries only self-contained,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"world-scoped rules that need nothing from the host. Rules that must reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"host entities are exposed as "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"parameterized methods","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" returning "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Rules","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"purchase(of:balance:charge:)"},{"type":"text","text":" above), which the host calls with its own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"declarations — every line still readable in the host’s source."}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gnusto\/gameplugin"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"inheritsFrom","kind":"relationships","title":"Inherits From"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A reusable game system — commerce, combat, dialog, magic — packaged as an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"importable unit of "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"verbs"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"rules"}]},{"type":"text","text":", that a host game opts into."}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/actions","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/command","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/gameText","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/player","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/rules","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/statusFields","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/timers","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/verbs","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/world"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Composing-Large-Games","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/SplittingAGameAcrossFiles","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ContentBundles","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Plugins","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContent","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContents","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ScoreDeclaring"],"title":"Composing Large Games","generated":true}],"references":{"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/SplittingAGameAcrossFiles":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/splittingagameacrossfiles","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/SplittingAGameAcrossFiles","title":"Splitting a Game Across Files","abstract":[{"text":"Keep a large game readable by composing its map and rules from per-region helpers.","type":"text"}],"role":"article"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GamePlugin/verbs":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gameplugin\/verbs","defaultImplementations":1,"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"verbs"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10SyntaxRuleV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SyntaxRule"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"title":"verbs","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Player-typeable verbs the plugin contributes, in the same form as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"game’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"verbs"},{"type":"text","text":". Defaults to empty. Precedence runs built-ins <"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bundles\/plugins < host game, so a host verb of the same shape beats"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this one."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/verbs","required":true,"role":"symbol"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GamePlugin/world":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"world"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5WorldV","text":"World"}],"title":"world","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gameplugin\/world","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/world","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The whole world — for plugin rules that apply everywhere."}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GamePlugin/timers":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gameplugin\/timers","defaultImplementations":1,"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"timers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TimedEvent"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"title":"timers","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Fuses and daemons the plugin contributes, in the same form as a game’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timers"},{"type":"text","text":". Defaults to empty. The host opts in by splicing:"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/timers","required":true,"role":"symbol"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/ContentBundles":{"type":"topic","kind":"article","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ContentBundles","abstract":[{"text":"Give a region its own declarations — its own type, and even its own package.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/contentbundles","title":"Content Bundles"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/WritingRules":{"type":"topic","title":"Writing Rules","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/WritingRules","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/writingrules","role":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Attach game logic to items, locations, and the world."}],"kind":"article"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GamePlugin/command":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gameplugin\/command","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"command","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Command","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto7CommandV"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/command","title":"command","abstract":[{"text":"The command currently being performed — usable as a bare identifier","